msgid "OpenRC Controller"
msgstr "OpenRC Controller"

msgid ""
"在系统应用菜单中打开“OpenRC 控制器”，或运行 ``openrc-controller``。 程序使用 C++、FLTK 原生 gtk+ "
"控件和系统中文翻译，不属于 Office 分组。"
msgstr ""
"Open OpenRC Controller from the system applications menu, or run ``openrc-"
"controller``. The program uses C++, FLTK native gtk+ widgets, and system "
"Chinese translations, and is not in the Office group."

msgid "权限与会话"
msgstr "Privileges and Sessions"

msgid ""
"root 账户直接进入。普通用户进入前选择 sudo 当前用户密码或 root 账户密码； 取消认证会退出程序。sudo 方式仍要求账户具有 sudo "
"权限，例如属于 wheel 组。 密码不保存，输入期间关闭输入法，认证后清除内存缓冲区。"
msgstr ""
"Root enters directly. Regular users choose either their current user's sudo "
"password or the root account password before entry; cancelling "
"authentication exits the program. The sudo method still requires sudo "
"authorization, such as wheel group membership. Passwords are not saved; "
"input methods are disabled during entry and the memory buffer is cleared "
"after authentication."

msgid ""
"图形界面保持启动用户身份；固定路径 ``/usr/lib/reliefos/apps/openrc-controller/openrc-"
"controller.elf --worker`` 作为受限 root 工作进程，处理校验过的服务、运行级别与配置请求。 "
"会话仅存在于本次应用运行期间，断开后需重新打开并认证。 sudoers 对该工作程序禁用 ``use_pty``，以保持二进制通信和 EOF 语义； "
"这条规则不会授予新的 sudo 权限，也不免除密码认证。"
msgstr ""
"The GUI retains the launching user's identity. The fixed path "
"``/usr/lib/reliefos/apps/openrc-controller/openrc-controller.elf --worker`` "
"runs as a restricted root worker, handling validated service, runlevel, and "
"configuration requests. The session exists only for this application run; "
"after disconnection, reopen and authenticate again. sudoers disables "
"``use_pty`` for this worker to preserve binary communication and EOF "
"semantics. This rule neither grants new sudo privileges nor waives password "
"authentication."

msgid "服务与运行级别"
msgstr "Services and Runlevels"

msgid ""
"服务表显示真实 OpenRC 状态、直接加入的运行级别和可用的运行时间。 左侧提供状态及运行级别筛选，上方可搜索，单击列标题排序。 Ctrl 或 "
"Shift 多选，工具栏提供启动、停止、重启、重载、启用与停用。"
msgstr ""
"The service table shows actual OpenRC status, directly assigned runlevels, "
"and available uptime information. The left pane filters by status and "
"runlevel, the top provides search, and column headers sort the table. Use "
"Ctrl or Shift for multiple selection; the toolbar offers Start, Stop, "
"Restart, Reload, Enable, and Disable."

msgid ""
"“启用／停用”对应 ``rc-update add/del``，改变启动配置； “启动／停止”改变当前运行状态。它们是独立的操作。 "
"批量请求按顺序执行，失败会停止后续请求，实际输出保留在“输出”页。 外部服务命令最长允许 180 秒，界面异步显示输出；取消或关闭可能留下过渡状态， "
"应先查看服务状态，再决定是否使用高级操作中的 ``zap``。 ``zap`` 仅重置 OpenRC 记录，不会停止实际进程。 "
"配置保存会完成当前原子提交，再处理取消或退出请求。"
msgstr ""
"Enable/Disable corresponds to ``rc-update add/del`` and changes startup "
"configuration; Start/Stop changes the current running state. These are "
"independent operations. Batch requests run sequentially and stop on failure,"
" with actual output retained on the Output page. External service commands "
"have a 180-second limit, with asynchronous output display. Cancellation or "
"closing may leave a transitional state; inspect service status before "
"deciding whether to use ``zap`` in Advanced Operations. ``zap`` only resets "
"OpenRC records and does not stop actual processes. A configuration save "
"completes its current atomic commit before handling cancellation or exit."

msgid ""
"高级操作可以指定服务公布的自定义命令，选择模拟执行、条件执行、 忽略依赖或调试模式。每个参数独立传递，不拼接 shell 命令。 "
"依赖页支持需要、使用、希望、排序及反向依赖类型。"
msgstr ""
"Advanced Operations can invoke custom commands advertised by a service and "
"select dry-run, conditional execution, dependency ignoring, or debug mode. "
"Arguments are passed separately, never concatenated into a shell command. "
"The Dependencies page supports need, use, want, ordering, and reverse "
"dependency types."

msgid ""
"运行级别菜单支持创建自定义级别、添加／删除成员、堆叠／取消堆叠、 删除空且未使用的自定义级别，以及切换普通运行级别。 "
"切换时可以选择仅启动目标服务，或完整切换。 完整切换可能停止网络和桌面需要的服务；程序不直接调用 "
"``sysinit``、``boot``、``single``、``shutdown`` 或 ``reboot`` 等特殊级别。 "
"“所有运行级别状态”显示上游 OpenRC 对堆叠和动态服务的原始解释。"
msgstr ""
"The Runlevels menu can create custom levels, add/remove members, "
"stack/unstack levels, delete empty unused custom levels, and switch ordinary"
" runlevels. Switching can either start target services only or perform a "
"full transition. A full transition may stop services needed by networking "
"and the desktop. The program does not directly invoke special levels such as"
" ``sysinit``, ``boot``, ``single``, ``shutdown``, or ``reboot``. All "
"Runlevel Status shows upstream OpenRC's raw interpretation of stacking and "
"dynamic services."

msgid "配置与工具"
msgstr "Configuration and Tools"

msgid ""
"可以编辑 ``/etc/conf.d/<服务>`` 和全局 ``/etc/rc.conf``。 保存保留原始文本、权限与所有者，检测外部修改，先生成 "
"``.openrc-controller.bak``，再原子替换并同步。 符号链接、非普通文件、不安全权限及大于 256 KiB 的配置会被拒绝。 "
"恢复备份前同样检查冲突，恢复时把现存内容保存成新的备份； 文件已删除时，按备份的所有者和权限重建，不放宽私有文件的权限。 "
"修改配置后是否需要重启服务由相应服务决定，程序不会隐式重启它。"
msgstr ""
"Edit ``/etc/conf.d/<服务>`` and global ``/etc/rc.conf``. Saving preserves "
"original text, permissions, and ownership, detects external changes, creates"
" ``.openrc-controller.bak``, then atomically replaces and syncs the file. "
"Symbolic links, nonregular files, unsafe permissions, and configurations "
"larger than 256 KiB are rejected. Restoring backups also checks conflicts "
"and saves current contents as a new backup. If a file has been deleted, it "
"is recreated with the backup's ownership and permissions without loosening "
"private-file permissions. Whether a service needs restarting after a "
"configuration change depends on that service; the program does not restart "
"it implicitly."

msgid ""
"工具菜单提供手动启动、未分配、崩溃及受监督服务查询，依赖缓存重建， OpenRC／启动／系统日志查看，以及诊断报告和文本导出。 "
"日志只读取已存在的常用文件，并显示最后至多 256 KiB； 文件不存在时请检查 ``rc_logger`` 或系统日志服务配置。 工具原始输出保留 "
"OpenRC 的术语，界面和操作提示支持中文。"
msgstr ""
"The Tools menu queries manual-start, unassigned, crashed, and supervised "
"services; rebuilds dependency caches; views OpenRC, boot, and system logs; "
"and provides diagnostic reports and text export. Logs are read only from "
"existing common files, displaying at most the final 256 KiB. If a file is "
"missing, check ``rc_logger`` or the system logging service configuration. "
"Raw tool output retains OpenRC terminology; the interface and operation "
"prompts support Chinese."

msgid "构建与验证"
msgstr "Build and Verification"

msgid "组件为 ``APP_OPENRC_CONTROLLER``，默认构建、打包和提供桌面入口。 使用正常 Kbuild 入口::"
msgstr ""
"The component is ``APP_OPENRC_CONTROLLER``, built, packaged, and given a "
"desktop entry by default. Use the normal Kbuild entry points::"

msgid ""
"宿主测试在私有 user namespace 和 chroot 中运行测试命令，不操作宿主 OpenRC。 完整系统验收脚本为 "
"``tools/test_openrc_controller_qemu.py``，使用私有镜像和服务夹具； "
"保留构建产物哈希、原始输出、截图和操作证据；默认退出私有来宾， 加 ``--keep-running`` 可继续进行手动图形界面检查。 VMware "
"验证未完成。"
msgstr ""
"Host tests run test commands in a private user namespace and chroot without "
"operating the host's OpenRC. The full-system acceptance script, "
"``tools/test_openrc_controller_qemu.py``, uses a private image and service "
"fixtures, retaining artifact hashes, raw output, screenshots, and operation "
"evidence. It exits the private guest by default; add ``--keep-running`` to "
"continue manual GUI inspection. VMware verification is incomplete."
